   125	`fj.frame.v2` (the ALFS frame) and the ALFS notes of `fj.frame.v1`, `fg.frameCompat.v1`, `fj.frameFeasible.v1` and `fj.twoChanges.core.v1` are in the registry since `4bc6690`. The status of `fj.frame.v2` is "def (spec text; red-team pending)": if the Astra red-team r158 changes it, re-read the entry before Tasks 6–7.
